   "recipe": "**Runs.** The 30 runs of Experiment 13 \u2014 at 5,000 tokens, seeds 1 to 10, 1,500 iterations \u2014 in three conditions: the baseline B1 (`B1-5000-s001` \u2026 `-s010`, shared with Experiment 12), its brains with one hidden layer of 16, and those brains changed only when copied. They are made with `python3 gol_lab.py run E13`.\n\n**Data.** From each run's `GraphOfLifeRuns/<run>/stats.jsonl`, which holds one row per recorded phase: `phase` 1 is the world just after reproduction, `phase` 2 just after the game, and every statistic is a field of the row (see [What a run records](frames-and-stats.md)).\n\n1. Take `births` / `nodes_before` of the rows with `phase` = 1, one line per run.\n2. For each condition, the median, quartiles and 5th and 95th percentiles of the runs at each iteration (`book_figures.band_series`).\n\n**To make it again:** `python3 book_figures.py seeing`."
